    "title": "Ellicottville Little Eagles Receive $10,000 Gift from Frank Pitillo Memorial Fund - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago The Ellicottville Little Eagles youth football program has received an extraordinary gift that will benefit its players for years to come. In a recent announcement, the organization shared that it was the recipient of a $10,000 donation from The Frank Pitillo Memorial Lighting Fund - a gesture they described as an act of “incredible generosity and support.” The funds will help sustain the Little Eagles league and ensure that young athletes in Ellicottville continue to have the opportunity to learn, grow, and thrive both on and off the field. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
